+Nullscape (Roblox, "collectathon roguelite", inspired by Wega's Challenge): survive and collect all the presents on endless, randomly generated levels. Enemies, upgrades and curses get added gradually as levels go up (curses at milestones). Latest: Patch 5.1 "Delusional Descension" (Oct 24 2026): new curses, upgrades and the Delusions mechanic. Wiki: nullscape.wiki.
+Classes: Diver (free, default; dive and jump out of dives), Charger (free; hold ability to charge through Tripmines), Spirit (1400 Tripcoins; leave your body as a fast spirit that absorbs one hit), Grappler (1800; hook platforms/jump pads/grapple points, meter drains), Glider (2000; glide, steer with camera, hitting surfaces boosts you up), Prisoner (level 25 Extreme badge; no ability, +25% Tripcoins), Wanted (level 25 Normal badge; ability only stops momentum, +10% speed).
+Enemies: Bell, Baby, Husk, ICBM, Mart, Springer, Flesh, Operator, Guardian, Telefragger (distortion field on high graphics), Kolona, Voidbound Baby/ICBM/Guardian (replace the normal ones), Voidbreaker, Cadence, Sigil, Scrapmaw (from level 25, rushes you then fires lasers), plus special Red Mart and Ponderer. Doom in Bloom added respawning thorn barriers and flower enemies.
+Not known in detail: exact enemy stats, spawn levels (except Scrapmaw), best upgrades. If unsure, say so and point to nullscape.wiki; never invent numbers.
+Details per topic (enemies, classes, curses, upgrades, modes) come with the question; trust those over this summary.
